<title>UK: SOCCER-MIDDLESBROUGH BEAT CHESTERFIELD 3-0 IN F.A. CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MIDDLESBROUGH BEAT CHESTERFIELD 3-0 IN F.A. CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SHEFFIELD, England 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Middlesbrough beat</p>
<p>Chesterfield 3-0 (halftime 1-0) in their English F.A. Cup</p>
<p>semifinal replay at Hillsborough on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Scorers: Mikkel Beck 12, Fabrizio Ravanelli 57, Emerson 89</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,339</p>
<p>Teams:</p>
<p>Middlesbrough: 25-Ben Roberts; 2-Neil Cox (3-Derek Whyte 70),</p>
<p>4-Steve Vickers, 5-Nigel Pearson, 6-Emerson, 8-Robbie Mustoe,</p>
<p>17-Clayton Blackmore, 21-Craig Hignett, 10-Juninho (20-Phil</p>
<p>Stamp 90), 9-Mikkel Beck, 11-Fabrizio Ravanelli (24-Chris</p>
<p>Freestone 90).</p>
<p>Chesterfield: 1-Billy Mercer; 2-Jamie Hewitt, 3-Mark Jules,</p>
<p>4-Tom Curtis, 5-Mark Williams, 6-Sean Dyche, 7-Kevin Davies, 8-</p>
<p>Paul Holland (12-Chris Beaumont 71), 9-Andy Morris, 10-Jonathan</p>
<p>Howard (14-Darren Carr 61), 11-Chris Perkins.</p>
<p>Middlesbrough will meet Chelsea in the final at Wembley on</p>
<p>May 17.</p>
</text>
